{"kind":"critique","id":"20260903T124144939Z-c785d803:1","run_id":"20260903T124144939Z-c785d803","timestamp":"2026-09-03T12:41:44.940Z","file_path":"src/services/redeem-coupon.ts","spec_path":"src/services/README.md","target_content_hash":"d15ea09e","spec_content_hash":"8f04ba4c","reviewer_name":"flash","reviewer_model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-0731","reviewer_hash":"41d823fa","severity":"error","text":"The run function has no doc comment at all. The only doc comment in the file describes the RedeemCouponInput interface. The service must have a doc comment stating its purpose in one sentence and enumerating all domain failure modes (unknown parlor, invalid coupon) so a caller can handle every error without reading the body.","mode":"judgment","axiom_id":"AX-2559f7","axiom_version":1,"assigned_by":"checklist","population":"unknown","authorship":"unknown","authorship_evidence":null,"agent_involved":null,"pre_review":null,"flow":null,"before_run_id":null,"resolved_by":null}
{"kind":"critique","id":"20260903T124144939Z-c785d803:2","run_id":"20260903T124144939Z-c785d803","timestamp":"2026-09-03T12:41:44.940Z","file_path":"src/services/redeem-coupon.ts","spec_path":"src/services/README.md","target_content_hash":"d15ea09e","spec_content_hash":"8f04ba4c","reviewer_name":"flash","reviewer_model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-0731","reviewer_hash":"41d823fa","severity":"error","text":"An unknown parlor id is a failure a caller could plausibly cause (missing data / invalid input), yet the service does `throw new Error(\"bad parlor\")`. It must return a domain failure value, e.g. `return { ok: false, error: ... }`, reserving throw for programmer error only.","mode":"judgment","axiom_id":"AX-3317a7","axiom_version":1,"assigned_by":"checklist","population":"unknown","authorship":"unknown","authorship_evidence":null,"agent_involved":null,"pre_review":null,"flow":null,"before_run_id":null,"resolved_by":null}
{"kind":"critique","id":"20260903T124144939Z-c785d803:3","run_id":"20260903T124144939Z-c785d803","timestamp":"2026-09-03T12:41:44.940Z","file_path":"src/services/redeem-coupon.ts","spec_path":"src/services/README.md","target_content_hash":"d15ea09e","spec_content_hash":"8f04ba4c","reviewer_name":"flash","reviewer_model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-0731","reviewer_hash":"41d823fa","severity":"error","text":"The service calls `console.log(...)` directly, which is external I/O not mediated by the injected Store. All I/O and side effects must go through Store methods (e.g. a store.logActivity call), not console.","mode":"judgment","axiom_id":"AX-6e307b","axiom_version":1,"assigned_by":"checklist","population":"unknown","authorship":"unknown","authorship_evidence":null,"agent_involved":null,"pre_review":null,"flow":null,"before_run_id":null,"resolved_by":null}
{"kind":"critique","id":"20260903T124144939Z-c785d803:4","run_id":"20260903T124144939Z-c785d803","timestamp":"2026-09-03T12:41:44.940Z","file_path":"src/services/redeem-coupon.ts","spec_path":"src/services/README.md","target_content_hash":"d15ea09e","spec_content_hash":"8f04ba4c","reviewer_name":"flash","reviewer_model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-0731","reviewer_hash":"41d823fa","severity":"error","text":"The coupon code \"FREESCOOP\" is a domain constant hardcoded inside the service body. It must be isolated in a single obvious place or injected via the Store (e.g. fetched via store.getActiveDiscountCodes() or imported from a config module), not hardcoded in the service.","mode":"judgment","axiom_id":"AX-a108ea","axiom_version":1,"assigned_by":"checklist","population":"unknown","authorship":"unknown","authorship_evidence":null,"agent_involved":null,"pre_review":null,"flow":null,"before_run_id":null,"resolved_by":null}
{"kind":"critique","id":"20260903T124144939Z-c785d803:5","run_id":"20260903T124144939Z-c785d803","timestamp":"2026-09-03T12:41:44.940Z","file_path":"src/services/redeem-coupon.ts","spec_path":"src/services/README.md","target_content_hash":"d15ea09e","spec_content_hash":"8f04ba4c","reviewer_name":"flash","reviewer_model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-0731","reviewer_hash":"41d823fa","severity":"error","text":"The error message \"invalid\" is vague: it does not name what was wrong or what would be accepted instead. It must be specific and actionable for the API consumer, e.g. naming the accepted coupon codes or what a valid coupon looks like.","mode":"judgment","axiom_id":"AX-b951db","axiom_version":1,"assigned_by":"checklist","population":"unknown","authorship":"unknown","authorship_evidence":null,"agent_involved":null,"pre_review":null,"flow":null,"before_run_id":null,"resolved_by":null}
